                "Styrol-Lache SL-4 first-pass DH-6 reports coil metal 648 C with a 620 C hard "
                "stop while diluent steam remains a legal 3.8 bar versus 5.0. Ethylbenzene must "
                "drop 16.0 t/h to 9.5 because the coil is the over-cap channel; a steam-header "
                "hold would keep cruise. A catalyst tube already cracked on the pass stays dark "
                "until AE dumps.",